OL,3,GNEWSAPeak District open-top bus boosted
OL,4,Aby heatwave summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus company says its open-top service
OL,7,Fthrough the Peak District National Park
OL,8,Fhas had more passengers, strong
OL,9,Fpositive feedback and helped to boost
OL,10,Flocal businesses after the hottest UK
OL,11,Fsummer on record.
OL,13,FThe Peak Sightseer began its fourth
OL,14,Fyear in May, running a circular route
OL,15,Faround Bakewell and Chatsworth House
OL,16,Fand another from the stately home to
OL,17,FCastleton.
OL,19,FStagecoach commercial director John
OL,20,FYoung said rides had increased by 9% on
OL,21,Flast year with just under 400
OL,22,Fpassengers per day.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
