OL,3,GNEWSAPeak District open-top bus boosted
OL,4,Aby heatwave summer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"That's a lot of people that we've
OL,7,Fgiven a really good enjoyable day out.
OL,8,FObviously, when it's a nice sunny day,
OL,9,Fand we've had lots of them this season,
OL,10,Fthen the service does well," he said.
